{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104310","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1910431001:1":{"text":"你们尝试安抚歌尼特，但他只是尖叫、尖叫、尖叫。","source_cn":"你们尝试安抚歌尼特，但他只是尖叫、尖叫、尖叫。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xDE85880E5169EBF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1910431002:1":{"text":"你能感受到他的情绪一潭死水。他的心中没有恶意，没有仇恨...","source_cn":"你能感受到他的情绪一潭死水。他的心中没有恶意，没有仇恨...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910431003:0":{"text":"那里只有最远古的、最无需掩盖的冲动——<style=h...","source_cn":"那里只有最远古的、最无需掩盖的冲动——<style=h...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1910431004:0":{"text":"你们束手无策，只能先回房休息，在不安中度过了一夜……","source_cn":"你们束手无策，只能先回房休息，在不安中度过了一夜……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x3C3691F9BFE489FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:1910431001":{"text":"1910431001","source":"1910431001","status":"source"},"speaker:1910431002":{"text":"1910431002","source":"1910431002","status":"source"},"speaker:1910431003":{"text":"1910431003","source":"1910431003","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"sp